# JSON text. toJson value encodes a value: records (and HashMaps with string
# keys) become objects keyed by each key's text, lists arrays, Bool True/False,
# integers exact numbers, Floats numbers; prettyJson encodes it indented by two
# spaces. fromJson text decodes one: objects become records of bare keys
# (r.status, r "Content-Type"), arrays lists, numbers Int or Float, null [].
